{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/9d8e9d1bd51708b250ca00f2ac6f21a1.poster.avif?t=1756323529\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/9d8e9d1bd51708b250ca00f2ac6f21a1.webm?t=1756323529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/9d8e9d1bd51708b250ca00f2ac6f21a1.mp4?t=1756323529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEEDTICKERS</strong> is a fast-paced 2D precision platformer where every second counts. Inspired by the breakneck speed of <i>Ultrakill</i> and the tight movement mechanics of <i>Celeste</i>, your goal is simple: complete short, intense levels before the timer hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/32239aee24851fda733c0ef83b361367.poster.avif?t=1756323529\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/32239aee24851fda733c0ef83b361367.webm?t=1756323529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/32239aee24851fda733c0ef83b361367.mp4?t=1756323529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your reflexes to the limit across <strong>90+ handcrafted levels,</strong> featuring original mechanics, tight controls, instant respawns, and a slick neo-futuristic pixel art style. Whether you're a casual player looking for quick challenges or a hardcore speedrunner aiming for hard yet simple games. <strong>SPEEDTICKERS</strong> delivers a satisfying loop of trial, mastery, and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>mod support</strong> and a custom <strong>level editor,</strong> play user made levels or create your own.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822390?t=1756323529","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/dc7618695049db4526cedf53f94376ec67dc637b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756323529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/38b90330b9524ec977b3edb67b879d5a341ce840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756323529","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/38b90330b9524ec977b3edb67b879d5a341ce840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756323529","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/9d8e9d1bd51708b250ca00f2ac6f21a1.poster.avif?t=1756323529\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/9d8e9d1bd51708b250ca00f2ac6f21a1.webm?t=1756323529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/9d8e9d1bd51708b250ca00f2ac6f21a1.mp4?t=1756323529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEEDTICKERS</strong> is a fast-paced 2D precision platformer where every second counts. Inspired by the breakneck speed of <i>Ultrakill</i> and the tight movement mechanics of <i>Celeste</i>, your goal is simple: complete short, intense levels before the timer hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/32239aee24851fda733c0ef83b361367.poster.avif?t=1756323529\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/32239aee24851fda733c0ef83b361367.webm?t=1756323529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/extras/32239aee24851fda733c0ef83b361367.mp4?t=1756323529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your reflexes to the limit across <strong>90+ handcrafted levels,</strong> featuring original mechanics, tight controls, instant respawns, and a slick neo-futuristic pixel art style. Whether you're a casual player looking for quick challenges or a hardcore speedrunner aiming for hard yet simple games. <strong>SPEEDTICKERS</strong> delivers a satisfying loop of trial, mastery, and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>mod support</strong> and a custom <strong>level editor,</strong> play user made levels or create your own.</p>","developers":["Juanes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822390/e22ef9c755ec27e5604e79427d185d25c7bdec29/header.jpg?t=1756323529","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 1.8 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available spa